# The pause and the key that ends it (fixtures/outside). P pauses the
# game, and P again ends the pause as P comes up, where LBA.EXE took that
# P for the next frame's and paused again. Then P pauses and Y ends it,
# and P pauses and Escape ends it, Escape then opening the quit menu as
# it did, whose first entry, Continue, Return chooses.

hold 0.05
sleep 40
key Down Return
sleep 3
key Return
hold 0.15
sleep 15
shot start
key p
sleep 1
shot pause
key p
sleep 2
shot after
key p
sleep 1
key y
sleep 2
shot y
key p
sleep 1
key Escape
sleep 2
shot quit
key Return
sleep 2
shot end
